  ],
  "limits": [
    "No live BDS/world/tick test; only the base provider implementation and valid fixture records",
    "Block-specific vtable overrides, registry population and constructors that select them remain unresolved",
    "Readable interfaces use STL adapters, not invented complete native declarations",
    "MXCSR1F80; NaN payloads and FP exception flags not guaranteed",
    "Output vector fixtures have valid bounded capacity; real allocation/lifetime not reconstructed"
  ]
